            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This dataset includes query and reference images for: (1) CDs, (2) DVDs, (3) books, (4) video clips, (5) landmarks, (6) business cards, (7) text documents, (8) paintings. The format is exactly as described in our 2011 ACM Multimedia Systems paper.",
